SUMMARY:Live: CALL IT OFF (Uhrzeit prüfen)
LOCATION:Viper Room
DESCRIPTION: CALL IT OFF 20.09.2026 – Eras Tour goes poppunk\, Wien – Viper Room Call It Off – a staple in the Dutch pop punk scene since 2013 – is taking a different route. In “Eras Tour goes pop punk”\, the band pays tribute to their musical hero  Taylor Swift with an explosive live show full of raw guitars\, scorching drums\, and a hefty dose of emotion and nostalgia. From ‘Love Story’ to ‘Fortnight’: Taylor’s biggest hits\, completely in Call It Off style. The love for Taylor had been there for years. Drummer Sergei: “When I first heard her songs in 2008\, it felt like I was listening to my own songwriting.” What started as a joke on the band bus – a short cover just for fun – blew up online so much that fans were begging for more. https://www.facebook.com/callitoffNL    
URL:https://www.viper-room.at/events/live-call-it-off-0926
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
